      ],
      "text": "Role in CRPS:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " NSAIDs = a common initial tx (effectiveness not well studied), typically short-term, may be combined w other tx; selective COX-2 inhibitors are an alt if nonselective NSAIDs aren't tolerated."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
